# Security headers for the website's static host (Netlify / Cloudflare Pages read this file as it is;
# on Render add the same headers under  Dashboard -> your Static Site -> Headers.  See SECURITY_HEADERS.md).
#
# The Content-Security-Policy is deliberately REPORT-ONLY: the browser lists anything the policy would
# block in its console, but blocks nothing, so this cannot break the live site. It was tried on all the
# main pages (home, about, history, events, gallery, contact, team, booking, calendar, tools, blogs,
# donate, privacy, terms, reset-password) with no violations. After a week without console reports on
# the live site, rename the header to  Content-Security-Policy  to enforce it.
#
# BEFORE USING: replace https://YOUR-API-HOST in connect-src with the real address of the backend API
# (the value of REACT_APP_API_URL without /api), and add any extra address the admin panel loads from.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://accounts.google.com/gsi/client; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com https://accounts.google.com/gsi/style; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; media-src 'self' blob: https://res.cloudinary.com; connect-src 'self' https://YOUR-API-HOST https://www.googleapis.com https://accounts.google.com/gsi/ https://api.open-meteo.com https://open.er-api.com https://www.usemiti.com https://res.cloudinary.com blob: data:; frame-src https://www.youtube.com https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://www.facebook.com https://www.google.com https://www.openstreetmap.org https://accounts.google.com; form-action 'self' https://rc-epay.esewa.com.np https://epay.esewa.com.np https://uat.connectips.com https://connectipswebgw.connectips.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=15552000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(self), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
